# Builds the neko asset tools (SWF/Animate exporter) from this fork's scripts/
# against the fork's upstream base, since this fork's src/ is JS-only.
# Requires a worktree of branch arm64-macos-tools-base at ../../openfl-base:
#   git worktree add ../openfl-base arm64-macos-tools-base
-main Tools
-neko tools.n
-lib hxp
-lib lime
-lib format
-cp ../../openfl-base/src
--macro openfl._internal.macros.ExtraParams.include()
-D lime-cairo
-D lime-cffi
-D optional-cffi
-D openfl
--remap flash:openfl
--no-inline
